Real-Time Use Case:
-------------------

    - multiple microservices
    - same pipeline steps:
        build
        test
        deploy
        notifications

    instead of copying code --> store in shared library and reuse

    Folder Structure:
    -----------------
    (shared-library-repo)
    Var/
        - build.groovy
    src/
        - com/
    resources/

    Key points:
    -----------
    vars/ - contains reusable functions
    src/ - groovy classes (advanced)
    resources/ - files like configs

